13. How to bring a fresh chat up to speed
Paste this into a new conversation, then share any specific file(s) you want to work on. That's enough context to skip the rediscovery phase.

Quick summary at the top: Laravel + Breeze + Vite + Tailwind v3 CMS. Two parallel layouts (layouts/admin.blade.php for admin, layouts/app.blade.php for public via <x-app-layout>). Self-hosted CKEditor 5 GPL build injected via dynamic import() in four editor blades with a hardcoded CSS <link>. Settings page drives --primary-color, --accent-color, --text-color, --heading-font, --body-font, --border-radius CSS variables; only text color and fonts are actually wired to elements via Tailwind config and body CSS rules.